begin;

-- Iceland: production has no `countries` row for IS (read-only check
-- 2026-10-30), and every IS city and restaurant below references one.
-- MICHELIN's Nordic Countries guide covers Iceland (2026 edition: 3 one-star
-- restaurants, 5 Key hotels). As in 20261023140000 for Ireland, the country
